{"unit_id":"tag:03QM:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>。若<MATH_0003>局部Noether（locally Noetherian），则<MATH_0004>也为Noether（Noetherian）的，且具有相同的完备化（completion）：<MATH_0005>。特别地，<MATH_0006>。Hensel化（henselization），对应于<MATH_0007>，通常远小于其完备化（completion），并继承其许多性质。例如，若<MATH_0008>约化（reduced），则<MATH_0009>也如此，但对完备化（completion）一般并非如此。在此插入后续参考文献。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部Noether"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"Noether"},{"source_term":"completion","target_term":"完备化"},{"source_term":"henselization","target_term":"Hensel化"},{"source_term":"completion","target_term":"完备化"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"},{"source_term":"completion","target_term":"完备化"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部Noether","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"Noether","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"completion","target_term":"完备化","context":"局部环的完备化。"},{"source_term":"henselization","target_term":"Hensel化","context":"局部环的Hensel化。"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":["原文保留Insert future references here占位句；候选忠实翻译，未补引用。"]}
